<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.8125.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.8125.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8125 against the dollar, down from 2.8055 yesterday and at 1.8705 against the mark, up from 1.8715, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
